<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>$365,000 Czech ATP tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Albert Portas (Spain)</p>
<p>2-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat 2-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>4-Cedric Pioline (France) Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-4 4-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Emilio Alvarez (Spain) beat Marcello Craca (Germany) 6-3 7-5</p>
</text>
